# Google OAuth client for LOCAL sign-in (Google Cloud Console > APIs & Services >
# Credentials > OAuth client ID > Web application).
# Authorized JavaScript origin:  http://localhost:3000
# Authorized redirect URI:       http://127.0.0.1:54321/auth/v1/callback
# Copy to supabase/.env (git-ignored), fill in, then restart: npx supabase@2.122.0 stop && npx supabase@2.122.0 start
SUPABASE_AUTH_EXTERNAL_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
SUPABASE_AUTH_EXTERNAL_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
